---
// src/components/StoreProtocol.astro
---

<!-- ⏳ Block 8: The 30-Day Transformation Protocol (Zero Scroll-Jacking • Mobile Fluid) -->
<section id="protocol-timeline" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#F9F9F6] text-[#111827] font-sans border-t border-gray-200/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
    
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100/70 border border-emerald-300/50 mb-3.5 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-700 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#166534] font-sans">
          The 30-Day Protocol
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-normal text-[#111827] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3">
        Your 30-Day <span class="italic text-[#166534]">Biological Rebirth.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans">
        True cellular renewal is not an overnight chemical spike. It is a compounding biological transformation. Here is what happens when you stay consistent.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* The 3 Compounding Milestones (Mobile Vertical Connected Flow / Desktop 3-Col Step Grid) */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-12">
      
      {/* Milestone 1: Day 1 - 7 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between relative group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-sans">
              Day 1 – 7
            </span>
            <span class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-200 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">01</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#111827] mb-2 leading-snug">
            The Awakening.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Highly bio-available organic iron and B-vitamins flood your bloodstream. The very first measurable shift? Your 3 PM afternoon energy slump completely disappears.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 font-sans">
          <span>⚡ Cellular Oxygenation Boost</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Milestone 2: Day 8 - 21 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between relative group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-sans">
              Day 8 – 21
            </span>
            <span class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-200 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">02</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#111827] mb-2 leading-snug">
            The Gut Cleanse.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Natural Chlorophyll-a neutralizes chronic stomach acidity and morning bloating. Bowel motility normalizes as healthy gut microbiome flora begins multiplying.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 font-sans">
          <span>🌿 Alkaline Digestive Balance</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Milestone 3: Day 22 - 30 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between relative group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-sans">
              Day 22 – 30
            </span>
            <span class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-200 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">03</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#111827] mb-2 leading-snug">
            The Deep Baseline.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Phycocyanin and Superoxide Dismutase (SOD) establish an antioxidant shield. Natural keratin strengthens hair roots and skin develops a healthy, clean glow.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 font-sans">
          <span>✨ Radiant Skin & Immune Baseline</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Risk Reversal Callout */}
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
      <a 
        href="#product-ecosystem" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#111827] hover:bg-[#166534] text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors shadow-md touch-manipulation cursor-pointer font-sans"
      >
        <span>Begin Your 30-Day Protocol →</span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 font-medium font-sans mt-2.5">
        Backed by our 30-Day Empty-Bottle Money-Back Guarantee. No questions asked.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>